            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Отобрази свойство <code>score</code> объекта <code>run1</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"148\" /><option startIndex=\"148\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"154\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(run1.score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>run1</code>, затем <code>.</code>, и наконец <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150030,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Попробуй вызвать метод <code>start()</code> через экземпляр <code>SpeedRun</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"205\" /><option startIndex=\"205\" endIndex=\"206\" /><option startIndex=\"206\" endIndex=\"211\" /><option startIndex=\"211\" endIndex=\"212\" /><option startIndex=\"212\" endIndex=\"213\" /><option startIndex=\"213\" endIndex=\"214\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>run1</code>, затем <code>.</code>, а затем <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 150031,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Сделай так, чтобы класс <code>ArcadeRun</code> наследовал от класса <code>GameRun</code> и вызови <code>start()</code> на объекте <code>ArcadeRun</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"191\" /><option startIndex=\"192\" endIndex=\"199\" /><option startIndex=\"283\" endIndex=\"287\" /><option startIndex=\"287\" endIndex=\"288\" /><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"293\" /><option startIndex=\"293\" endIndex=\"294\" /><option startIndex=\"294\" endIndex=\"295\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ArcadeRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ArcadeRun(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run2.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>extends</code>, затем <code>GameRun</code>, а затем <code>run2</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
